Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:01.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same seatbelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Only one car\Nhas an airbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:05.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,The belt\Nholds your chest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:06.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,but your\Nhead keeps going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:08.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,and without an\Nairbag it hits
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:08.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,the steering wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:10.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,A crash sensor\Nfeels the car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:12.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,slow down in\Nthe first few
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:12.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,milliseconds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,and decides\Nin an instant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:15.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,that this is\Na real crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,It fires a\Ntiny igniter inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:18.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,the steering wheel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:20.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,which sets off\Na gas generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,The gas splits\Nthe cover along
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:23.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,a hidden seam
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and fills the\Nfolded bag in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:26.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,about\Nthirty milliseconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:27.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here is the clever part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:28.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,The bag has holes in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.19,0:00:30.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,As your head\Nsinks in the gas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,escapes through\Nthe vents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,so the bag\Nslows you down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:34.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,gently instead\Nof bouncing you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:35.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:36.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,That is why\Nyou should sit back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.65,0:00:37.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,from the wheel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.49,0:00:38.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,and always\Nwear your belt.
